  "text": "Table 2.6a Outbuilding provisions: maximum wall height 3m. C2.6.2 Notwithstanding C2.6.1(i), an outbuilding can have a wall height of up to 3.5m where the external wall and roof materials and finishes (including colour) are the same as those of the dwelling on the same site.",
